  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Allez tout droit vers le drapeau bleu.",
      "sha256": "6517bcea0bb01e267b5a9bd734297d60169a0305d1b7cf5ade83e7f2256bb962",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Au marché, une vendeuse propose un bon gâteau et une pomme.",
      "sha256": "c9dbdadada8d119e5628a2fcbef95a53b0413b28f42044735f35c09eedb152da",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, je cherche le train pour ce trajet direct.",
      "sha256": "bca3bafaa6a37de6bab18b84b86cf3569b3e4b39739e1506dd27a71823ba4a93",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, je prends une bonne pomme et un gâteau.",
      "sha256": "de24ab00a83c0bd053959048c05a263e27a29164f3ccd2865d09197a2e0cfc16",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, quel est le prix de la visite ?",
      "sha256": "aa09dc73ade43942ee06e1c5ba059584dbafdd6817b935b069eef47dfc61c69b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "C'est un bon gâteau.",
      "sha256": "52e2d317a9396e41a1255590fbdc864e0f50a9737a3e629ca24f79e3bed03a8d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce trajet est direct.",
      "sha256": "b96865cc8c0d750baca006d02adae33f8c5ba5700b1d5ed97b566cf8be8a942b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il y a du bruit dans la rue.",
      "sha256": "01c6c0b0e179d96e9161441a71707f3e518e9a7d1ec14eae45c527ad63dc2fe2",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "J'ai l'adresse de la gare.",
      "sha256": "1a721c8d014e849f8484162372b08c21d60cbbfdabc3da46d54c33ff4f873462",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je choisis une bonne pomme et je demande le prix du gâteau.",
      "sha256": "f467f864e922acdb3082091426a79c11b834ef27414ddb018d48d85b60411d5a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je lui dis mon nom et elle répète : « Une pomme et un gâteau. »",
      "sha256": "e5591f8a6357d7088d2b62addd6664476158a6804e27858ade5b600a709348f8",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je me rapproche, prêt à prendre la brochure et à écouter son explication.",
      "sha256": "deaf3d2a6f6aacb2bc4852e19deac98597a93f03f070c64a4976a3d6b5454a50",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je porte le sac sous le bras.",
      "sha256": "09e2fa46594226294e06df1d199d9684e5e2e0f6ff72ceb745431235562dd02c",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je prends une bonne pomme.",
      "sha256": "908290606cf0e0c8ef885b332f9ffb7be0905e6809cd338e2ac3a46b89ed5410",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je suis prêt à prendre la brochure.",
      "sha256": "6808eb6dd6b4ef0e1a2abb8bd574498a76a8010324c1a9cac97ef3935e894c39",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je trouve le bon train et je monte avant le départ.",
      "sha256": "955d094d3addd6194d329ddc0e16adfef9334fac91d5a451a1b98c4d0012e6d3",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L'employée me tend une brochure, mais le bruit de la rue couvre sa voix.",
      "sha256": "b934080873260fe43934f6ce325f5cfba5649b2b445f2e13b449ccc82fc9ee96",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le train part dans trois minutes.",
      "sha256": "0dd6ac2fa1037138d47b2777ce70c9b7e950a9a9a46069ce466b976253fd7e8a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, je prends la brochure.",
      "sha256": "47e04e46873d9056b212231d21152c95ad84d9fd3462eaee102423a5dc27fadd",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, je vais tout droit vers le bon train.",
      "sha256": "97b010c4aaadf7c0c2176cd0cb7a05998867a1b152f770c0d8f87cc8d6dbcc5f",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, voici mon nom pour la commande.",
      "sha256": "3d7cfb22890abfe22985b2cfef65d050342a56852f59b9ddfdf4f43c786ff9ea",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour garder ma commande de côté, la vendeuse me demande mon nom.",
      "sha256": "2de353fd25e3ccc438bb59b971d154b261eea4fefc0f7b2046a8a673b7da7c99",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Puis je glisse la brochure dans le sac que je porte sous le bras.",
      "sha256": "e98104b0fb24c3e127468f9d965c0d37e8cd1e29de025301b480d9a8f8c77079",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Quel est le prix de la visite ?",
      "sha256": "3453981cfa2df10c72757a1a1605196e0d903c42f1b9fe8ca55488d4e10ce637",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:17:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Quel est votre nom ?",
      "sha256": "150ef9cf3b768f40d13b9a02857d8ee0e85e9b26540f62604751b04ec98137d6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:16:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Trois trains sont annoncés, mais un seul suit le trajet direct.",
      "sha256": "fdae9548dbb65d0a0f5bffc2456a24079600d15a25c7e30fa79bf6bafeab8fc1",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Un agent me dit d'aller tout droit vers le drapeau bleu près du quai.",
      "sha256": "9c9c5d6501a98334beb367a46d919f3cb43d0356cc8152b017159e2492c90b3e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:18:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pomme et un gâteau, s'il vous plaît.",
      "sha256": "b8d113744b3a64f8ae3cc46f6391a9991397cc2a0958758d9000b316852f790e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
